OL,3,GNEWSAPolice force 'committed' to
OL,4,Arooting out corruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior Derbyshire Police officer said
OL,7,Fit is "understandable" people have lost
OL,8,Ftrust in the force and that rooting out
OL,9,F"corruption and poor performance" was a
OL,10,Ftop priority.
OL,12,FTemporary Chief Constable Simon
OL,13,FBlatchly spoke out after three
OL,14,Fhigh-profile misconduct hearings, in
OL,15,Fwhich two officers were sacked and a
OL,16,Fthird was charged with misconduct in a
OL,17,Fpublic office.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
