OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice force 'committed' to
OL,4,Arooting out corruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne officer was sacked over racist and
OL,7,Fsexist remarks, a former sergeant was
OL,8,Fcharged with abusing his position, and
OL,9,Fa former officer was sacked over
OL,10,Fmotoring offences.
OL,12,F"I just want to root out any
OL,13,Fcorruption, any poor performance. It's
OL,14,Fnot acceptable," Blatchly said during a
OL,15,Fhotseat interview with BBC Radio Derby
OL,16,Fon Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
